{{Quote|Spawns a mischievous trio of Rascals! The boy takes the lead, while the girls pelt enemies from behind... with slingshots full of Double Trouble Gum!}}

The Rascals is a {{Rarity|Common}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked from the [[Arenas|Rascal's Hideout (Arena 13)]]. It spawns a single-target, ground-targeting, melee, ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] with high hitpoints and moderate damage output in front of two single-target, air-targeting, medium-ranged, ground troops with low hitpoints and moderate damage. The Rascals features a boy who has black eyes and eyebrows, dons a bowl cut which covers his eyes, wears a team-colored tunic, a black hood and pants, wields a wooden sword, carries a medium-sized pouch on his waist attached with a rope, and is barefoot, with the girls appearing similarly to [[Archers]] and being dressed similarly to the boy, except they have brown eyes and aquamarine hair, wear eyepatches, gloves and shoes, and wield slingshots with an attached team-colored rubber band. A Rascals card costs 5 [[Elixir]] to deploy.

